title: "Choosing the Observation Point: Representation- vs. Effect-Level Monitoring of LLM Code-Agents Under Obfuscation"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-06-19
authors:
  - family-names: "Jain"
    given-names: "Nishita"
